{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144769,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Figure X. Transfer ROC-AUC of the Fixed-Recipe Models by Training and Test Dataset\nNote. Three-seed mean-logit ensembles, plain variant. Rows are training datasets and columns are test datasets; the bold diagonal is in-distribution. C23 and C40 = FaceForensics++ DeepFakes at compression C23 and C40; CDF = Celeb-DF v2; DFo = DeeperForensics-1.0. — = not evaluated (C40 was not a transfer source). Colors do not distinguish values below 0.5."}},
